## Suggested order in one line

**Foundations → build the project (your plan) → add auth → deploy it → build 2–3 more → apply for jobs.**

Your instinct for how to build a project was already right. This just surrounds it with the parts that turn "I built an app" into "I'm a full-stack developer."
